# Dawn (CoP 8-4): the Cermet Portal _0zy (The Garden of Ru'Hmet; trigger stands the char east of it, z 360; trigger
# here keeps the walked z). Main (When Angels Fall current at Status 1): its own script: PORTAL_SEALED (7673) at z
# 360; at z 365: its own 139. bob (8-4 current): z 360: 140; z 361: 141. cat (The Last Verse current: 8-4 completed):
# z 360: 140; z 365: 141.
lists TheGardenOfRuhmet/_0zy/onTrigger
char zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=-420,-2,355 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=-420,-2,355 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char cat zone=TheGardenOfRuhmet pos=-420,-2,355 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Cop WhenAngelsFall current
charvar Mission[6][828]Status 1
bob: mission Cop Dawn current
cat: mission Cop TheLastVerse current
login
trigger _0zy
finish-if-event
walk -420,-2,365
trigger _0zy here
finish-if-event
bob: login
bob: trigger _0zy
bob: finish
bob: walk -420,-2,361
bob: trigger _0zy here
bob: finish
cat: login
cat: trigger _0zy
cat: finish
cat: walk -420,-2,365
cat: trigger _0zy here
cat: finish
